[2026.09.09-10.26.31:050][  0]LogTextLocalizationResource: Warning: Text translation conflict for namespace "LinuxDynamicRHI" and key "NoVulkanDriver".
[2026.09.09-10.26.31:050][  0]LogTextLocalizationResource: The current translation is "엔진 실행에 필요한 Vulkan 드라이버 로드에 실패했습니다.
